iv class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/925567658be92d3c4450d1f316c88488.avif?t=1747914761\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sea of Thieves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 2025 Base Edition includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/65785fe07502ede25e03a5148f8141d2.poster.avif?t=1747914761\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/65785fe07502ede25e03a5148f8141d2.webm?t=1747914761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/65785fe07502ede25e03a5148f8141d2.mp4?t=1747914761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/f9c4e37abf4f882e6e8c1f0d868dc748.webp?t=1747914761\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional digital bonuses* include access to the Sea of Thieves Original Soundtrack \u2013 2025 Edition, the Sea of Thieves: Athena's Fortune audiobook and The Rough Guide to Sea of Thieves eBook\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Available to download from Sea of Thieves /bonuses (website login required) or via Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172620/extras/f9c4e37abf4f882e6e8c1f0d868dc748.webp?t=1747914761\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Sea of Thieves is a smash-hit pirate adventure game, offering the quintessential pirate experience of plundering lost treasures, intense battles, vanquishing sea monsters and more. Dive in with this revised edition of the game, which includes access to digital bonus media.",
